00:56:03,720 --> 00:56:11,360
is not only seen as a necessity, but as a responsibility. Seneca and Epictetus stressed that

482
00:56:11,360 --> 00:56:18,600
the basis for facing any adversity with wisdom and calm lies in taking care of oneself,

483
00:56:18,600 --> 00:56:25,760
both physically and emotionally. Self-care, far from being a luxury,

484
00:56:25,760 --> 00:56:33,920
is an act of discipline and mental self-care, which allows the person to be more efficient, resilient

