00:58:59,560 --> 00:59:06,080
or personal growth, we lose the power to be resilient when life challenges us.

507
00:59:06,080 --> 00:59:12,080
Self-care is also intrinsically linked to the practice of mindfulness

508
00:59:12,080 --> 00:59:18,520
or full attention. This concept, although it does not belong exclusively to Stoic philosophy

