00:59:32,800 --> 00:59:39,320
allows us to better understand our internal needs and how to properly care for them. Mindfulness

512
00:59:39,320 --> 00:59:44,120
helps us listen to our bodies, minds, and hearts,

513
00:59:44,120 --> 00:59:49,400
giving us the ability to make wiser, more balanced decisions.

514
00:59:49,400 --> 00:59:55,600
In daily life, self-care can be applied in many practical ways. From making sure

515
00:59:55,600 --> 01:00:03,120
we sleep the necessary hours, maintaining a balanced diet and practicing physical exercise,

516
01:00:03,120 --> 01:00:11,000
to dedicating time to meditation, reading and reflecting on our goals and actions.

517
01:00:11,000 --> 01:00:17,840
It also involves learning to say no to what exhausts us or what does not contribute positively to

518
01:00:17,840 --> 01:00:25,000
our well-being. Setting clear boundaries and prioritizing our mental and emotional health is

519
01:00:25,000 --> 01:00:32,040
key to maintaining our internal strength. Self-care, then, is the foundation on which

520
01:00:32,040 --> 01:00:39,880
an invincible mind is built. If we do not take care of ourselves, if we do not recognize our needs,

521
01:00:39,880 --> 01:00:47,160
we will be more vulnerable to external influences, challenges and setbacks in

522
01:00:47,160 --> 01:00:52,640
life. Only by nourishing our mind and body can we maintain the energy and

523
01:00:52,640 --> 01:00:59,880
clarity necessary to effectively address the difficulties that arise along the way.

524
01:00:59,880 --> 01:01:07,600
Self-care is ultimately an act of respect and self-love. Marcus Aurelius,

525
01:01:07,600 --> 01:01:14,720
the Stoic emperor, said: "The life of each of us is what we make of it."

526
01:01:14,720 --> 01:01:20,000
This statement invites us to reflect on the responsibility we have towards

527
01:01:20,000 --> 01:01:26,960
ourselves and towards our well-being. If we do not take care of ourselves, if we do not value our health,

528
01:01:26,960 --> 01:01:33,160
we cannot expect to perform at our best or face life's challenges with wisdom and courage.

529
01:01:33,160 --> 01:01:42,360
At the end of the day, self-care is not a luxury, it's a necessity. It is the foundation of a balanced life,

530
01:01:42,360 --> 01:01:49,200
a resilient mind, and a person capable of serving the world from a place of inner strength.

531
01:01:49,200 --> 01:01:56,200
Through the practice of self-care, we not only protect ourselves, but we also

532
01:01:56,200 --> 01:02:05,160
prepare ourselves to help others more effectively and meaningfully. Thus, self-care

533
01:02:05,160 --> 01:02:12,400
becomes one of the most powerful tools to forge an invincible mind.

