679
01:19:05,160 --> 01:19:12,480
Patience is the key to allowing true change to occur within us.

680
01:19:12,480 --> 01:19:19,680
Another interesting analogy comes from nature: bamboo, for example, can spend

681
01:19:19,680 --> 01:19:27,520
