682
01:19:27,520 --> 01:19:35,160
preparing to grow robustly and quickly when the right time comes. That waiting period

683
01:19:35,160 --> 01:19:43,200
is not time wasted, but time spent strengthening your foundation, preparing for what

684
01:19:43,200 --> 01:19:50,440
