685
01:19:50,440 --> 01:19:58,600
with the process, knowing that we are preparing for something bigger, stronger, more lasting.

686
01:19:58,600 --> 01:20:05,520
Furthermore, patience is essential to maintain inner peace. In such a fast-paced world

687
01:20:05,520 --> 01:20:12,040
full of external stimuli, the practice of being patient allows us to remain calm even

688
01:20:12,040 --> 01:20:19,280
in the most turbulent situations. Patience does not prevent us from acting, but rather allows us to act

689
01:20:19,280 --> 01:20:26,240
more wisely, at the appropriate time. For example, when faced with a challenge,

690
01:20:26,240 --> 01:20:32,400
patience prevents us from making hasty decisions, giving us the opportunity to

691
01:20:32,400 --> 01:20:39,160
reflect on the matter, clear our minds, and act more effectively.

692
01:20:39,160 --> 01:20:45,520
Patience is also one of the fundamental pillars for those seeking

693
01:20:45,520 --> 01:20:52,720
lasting emotional balance. When we face intense emotions like anger or frustration,

694
01:20:52,720 --> 01:20:59,680
patience teaches us not to react impulsively. Instead, it gives us the

695
01:20:59,680 --> 01:21:06,640
opportunity to reflect on what we are feeling, the reason for those feelings, and how

696
01:21:06,640 --> 01:21:13,040
we can handle them more constructively. Controlling emotions is one of the

697
01:21:13,040 --> 01:21:21,280
